---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updated = 'October 25, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Do Code That Matters"
  description="Privacy policy for docodethatmatters.com."
>
  <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-2xl">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p class="mb-6 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">
      Last updated: {updated}
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-6 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">Short version</h2>
        <p>
          This is a personal blog. It uses Google Analytics to understand how people use the site, and
          it collects only what you send through the contact form. There are no ads, no data sales,
          and no accounts.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">Google Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          The site uses Google Analytics to collect anonymous usage statistics, such as which pages
          are visited, where visitors come from, and what kind of device they use. Google stores this
          data in the United States and may set cookies on your browser. You can opt out by installing
          the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" class="hover:underline" style="color: var(--color-accent);">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.
          Google's own privacy policy is at
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="hover:underline" style="color: var(--color-accent);">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">Contact form</h2>
        <p>
          The contact form on the
          <a href="/about/" class="hover:underline" style="color: var(--color-accent);">About page</a>
          collects the email address and message you submit, and uses them only to reply to you.
          Messages are relayed through a third-party service (AWS API Gateway) on their way to me; I
          do not keep a database of submitted messages.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">Local storage</h2>
        <p>
          The site stores your light/dark theme preference in your browser's local storage. It never
          leaves your device.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          The only cookies this site sets are the ones set by Google Analytics. There are no
          advertising or marketing cookies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          You can block cookies entirely in your browser settings; the site will still work. You can
          also opt out of Google Analytics with the add-on linked above.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">Changes</h2>
        <p>
          I may update this policy from time to time. The "last updated" date above reflects the most
          recent change.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy? Use the
          <a href="/about/" class="hover:underline" style="color: var(--color-accent);">contact form on the About page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
